# Failure-directed refinement must learn a predicate, not individual inputs.

```catala
declaration scope RefinedCall:
  input permitted content boolean
  input amount content integer
  output result content integer

scope RefinedCall:
  assertion permitted
  definition result equals if amount > 0 then 1 else 0

declaration scope SemanticRefinement:
  input enabled content boolean
  input permitted content boolean
  input amount content integer
  output result content integer

scope SemanticRefinement:
  definition result equals
    if enabled then
      (output of RefinedCall with {
        -- permitted: permitted
        -- amount: amount
      }).result
    else if not permitted then 2 else 3
```
